  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The near future",
   "texto": [
    "**aller** is used in this + **infinitivo**, as is «go to» in Spanish, but **sin «a»**: **Je vais voir mes parents** (I will see my parents).",
    "Denial: **Je ne vais pas travailler**. Question: **Qu'est-ce que tu vas faire ?**",
    "Future words: **demain** (tomorrow), **ce soir** (tonight), **ce week-end** (this weekend), **la semaine prochaine** (next week)."
